+- **Inputs:** Scene function $f(x, \theta)$ (the renderer), current parameters $\theta \in \Theta$, kernel standard deviation $\sigma$, number of samples $N$.
+- **Outputs:** Gradient estimate $\nabla_\theta Q(\theta)$.
 
