+The Monte Carlo estimator for $Q(\theta)$ is [S1]:
 $$
-\kappa(\tau) = \frac{1}{\sigma \sqrt{2\pi}} \exp\left(\frac{-\tau^2}{2\sigma^2}\right)
+\hat{Q} \approx \frac{1}{N} \sum_{i=1}^{N} \kappa(\tau_i) f(x_i, \theta - \tau_i)
